    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr. Asad Abbas performed the first ever successful grafting operation of Plastic Cornea in Pakistan. Dr. Asad Abbas, Senior Instructor, Department of Ophthalmology, Aga Khan University Hospital, operated on a patient whose vision had been impaired due to an accident involving acid.",
